# Saga project-layer notes are private for now. The project layer is designed
# for team use, but today saga is single-user: notes here are working memory,
# not documentation. Revisit if/when saga becomes a team tool.
# meta.yml and the topics README stay tracked so a clone still has a layer
# definition and an explanation of what belongs here.
.saga/topics/*.md
!.saga/topics/README.md

# Internal working docs — contain client/project names and work-PC paths.
# NEVER commit to this public repo.
/saga-estudo-utilizacao-*.md
/saga-plano-melhorias-*.md
/HANDOVER-*.md

